Implement Phase 3: Authentication and Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).

## Project Context

AssureX is an insurance claims platform where customers submit claims, reviewers inspect suspicious claims, and administrators manage the platform.

The solution must be production-ready, secure, modular, and scalable.

---

## Objectives

Build a complete authentication and authorization system including:

* User registration
* User login
* User logout
* Password hashing
* JWT authentication
* Role-based access control (RBAC)
* Protected API endpoints
* User management

---

## Technology Stack

Use:

* Python
* Flask
* Flask-SQLAlchemy
* Flask-JWT-Extended
* Flask-Bcrypt
* Flask-Migrate
* Marshmallow

Follow Flask Blueprint architecture.

