## User Roles

Implement the following roles:

### Customer

Permissions:

* Register account
* Login/logout
* Create claims
* View own claims
* Update own profile

### Service Center Employee

Permissions:

* View assigned claims
* Update claim processing status
* Upload supporting documents

### Claim Reviewer

Permissions:

* View claims flagged for manual review
* Approve claims
* Reject claims
* Add review notes
* View fraud-risk indicators

### Administrator

Permissions:

* Full system access
* Manage users
* Manage roles
* View analytics
* Manage policies
* Configure fraud detection settings
* Access all claims

