## Database Design

Create a User model containing:

* id
* full_name
* email
* password_hash
* role
* is_active
* created_at
* updated_at

Role values:

* customer
* employee
* reviewer
* admin

Requirements:

* Email must be unique
* Passwords must never be stored in plain text
* Password hashing must use Bcrypt
* Include password verification methods

